.\n\nAfter a disaster, experts are called in to investigate and report. This means establishing timelines, gathering evidence, and, when possible, recording eyewitness testimony. Join Disaster Detectives Joseph and Katie as they comb through their Disaster Dossier to find out what happened and discover the brilliant solutions humans have developed to help predict, prevent, or respond to future disasters!\n\nBased on the best-selling book Real-life Disasters by Susan Martineau, The Disaster Detectives takes a reassuring approach and promotes curiosity, critical thinking, and problem-solving. \n\nGreat for investigators ages 7 and up. Visit us at TheDisasterDetectives.com to learn more!\n\nThis podcast contains ads. Yoto does not control these ads and they do not represent us or our opinions. Please listen with care.","author":"Joseph Edward Degnan and Katie Sparks","lastBuildDate":"2024-10-29T08:40:16.224Z","imageUrl":"https://assets.pippa.io/shows/6669aa58a033650012cdaab9/1718362902735-8cd32077ee95deb13a326b3010800cca.jpeg","feedUrl":"https://feeds.acast.com/public/shows/the-disaster-detectives","playbackDirection":"desc","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/38Q9crw0oMDEv_1fLdDXzqg4J8ARyI8M71_BnJ4hxKk"},"media":{"duration":0,"fileSize":0},"languages":["en"],"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2024-10-29T08:42:53.381Z"}},"cardId":"gYWH5","createdAt":"2024-10-29T08:41:06.330Z","updatedAt":"2025-01-09T13:12:53.192Z","lastCheckedAt":"2026-11-01T03:46:34.073Z","availability":"free"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":true,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}